(c4) CRUX[Faithful cross, above all other, ](d) fi(e)dé(gh)lis,(hg) in(h)ter(j) o(ji)mnes(hg) (,) 
Ar[One and only noble Tree,](i)bor(j) u(kl)na(hg) nó(j)bi(ih)lis:(h) (:) (z) 
Nul[None in foliage, none in blossom, ](h)la(hji) sil(g)va(ge) ta(f)lem(dc) pro(de)fert,(efe) (,) 
Fron[None in fruit thy peer may be.](d)de,(dh) flo(hg)re,(ed) gér(f)mi(ed)ne:(d) (:) (z)
* Dul[Sweet the wood, and sweetest iron; ](h)ce(hji) li(g)gnum,(ge) dul(f)ces(dc) cla(de)vos,(efe) (,) 
Dul[Sweetest Weight is hung on thee.](d)ce(dh) pon(hg)dus(ed) sú(f)sti(ed)net.(d) (::)
